クです。\n\nどんな作品になるか楽しみです。\n\nsnsで使う予定です。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/u/0/folders/1lyx3JwZZ52wPSvJAJm4DXDM2YNnmjDON", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@mcomcomco5/works/25", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/2d53a9bd/uploads/origins/e30c2c65-859f-4567-9e99-f61ca30efdb6?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4a2452bf0bb442dc1313e9b4bad4688f", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/2d53a9bd/uploads/origins/e30c2c65-859f-4567-9e99-f61ca30efdb6?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4a2452bf0bb442dc1313e9b4bad4688f, https://si.imgix.net/2d53a9bd/uploads/origins/e30c2c65-859f-4567-9e99-f61ca30efdb6?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f689702c467687ed35e4baffc7189324 2x, https://si.imgix.net/2d53a9bd/uploads/origins/e30c2c65-859f-4567-9e99-f61ca30efdb6?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bd8518e7e85aa96f9084fd1690ebf75e 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello! \n I would be very happy if you could accept my request! I would like art of my Vtuber. I'm a Koi fish Vtuber that likes is very fun and playful. Pose is up to you! I like playing YuGiOh, and eating fish! \n\nI would be so happy if you could animate it like the previous one you did too! https://skeb.jp/@mcomcomco5/works/12\n\n I would like to use this on social media like Twitter and Youtube. I may use it as a Youtube Thumbnail! Thank you so much for your consideration!\n\nRef: https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1_0IBEMbp_fbaQrltqMe-cEtccwB-Lvfj?usp=sharing\n\nI look forward to seeing the final work :)", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@mcomcomco5/works/24", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/926df77c/uploads/origins/c73e911b-ee87-42f8-8b0b-87b27e26271b?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=c0cb24da933d4bbc36fabc6eb3f3c